  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring peaceful coexistence between communities in West Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project is to contribute to restoring peaceful coexistence between communities in West Darfur: - Mediation support to local authorities in cooperation with UNITAMS/UN contributes to the resolution of inter-communal conflict, the prevention of violence and sustainable peace in West Darfur. - Support to strengthen community early warning systems for stronger community protection. - Increased community engagements through community centres - Access to basic services&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
